      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَرْجَارٌ</span></b>  A camel <i>that reiterates sounds in his
windpipe:</i> (S:) or a camel <i>that makes much
noise</i> [or <i>braying</i>]; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِرْجِرٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُرَاجِرٌ</span></b> .
(K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  The <i>sound of thunder.</i> (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <i>A certain
plant,</i> (S, K,) <i>of sweet odour;</i> (S;) <i>a certain
herb having a yellow flower.</i> (AHn, TA.)

